dMotion]]></Text><Enum>8</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[Axis is coupled to a master axis and following synchronized setpoints (e.g. gearing, camming).]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text><![CDATA[ResetPending]]></Text><Enum>10</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[An error reset has been requested and is being processed.]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text><![CDATA[Enabling]]></Text><Enum>11</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[Axis is in the process of being enabled (drive power stage is starting up).]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text><![CDATA[Disabling]]></Text><Enum>12</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[Axis is in the process of being disabled (drive power stage is shutting down).]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text><![CDATA[NotReady]]></Text><Enum>13</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[Axis is not ready for operation, e.g. waiting for required sub-modules to initialize or to start up.]]></Comment></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>plcAttribute_qualified_only</Name></Property><Property><Name>plcAttribute_strict</Name></Property><Property><Name>plcAttribute_to_string</Name></Property></Properties><Hides><Hide GUID="{64ADA9A8-4EAE-4872-9C2D-E6B7FA96B984}" /></Hides></DataType><DataType><Name GUID="{E7BFE865-900F-4F3A-B607-76F75FE96459}" Namespace="MC" TcBaseType="true">CDT_MCTOPLC_AXIS_STD</Name><BitSize>192</BitSize><SubItem><Name>AxisOid</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-00000000000F}">OTCID</Type><Comment><![CDATA[Object ID of the axis for identification.]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>AxisState</Name><Type GUID="{4FF974A8-531B-49D0-8DF5-E3398C9DA9C3}" Namespace="MC">EAxisState</Type><Comment><![CDATA[Current state of the axis state machine.]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>IsInControl</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000030}">BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[TRUE if the axis controller is actively controlling the drive (control loop closed).]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>48</B