		This function block resets all motion object-related errors and transitions the motion object out of state ErrorStop.<br/>
		The resulting state is Disabled, if no Enable is requested for the motion object (e.g. via MC_Power).<br/>
		It results in DiscreteMotion, if the motion object has a closed control loop and a controlled error reaction is still ongoing.<br/>
