		This function block waits for a stable actual position.
		The command is always buffered and may only be triggered when the previous command ends with zero dynamics.
	 ]]></Comment><BitSize>1216</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Axis</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_Mc3Ptp" ReferenceTo="true">AXIS_REF</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Reference to the axis ]]></Comment><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>InOut</Value></Property><Property><Name>Namespace</Name><Value>Tc3_Mc3Ptp</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Execute</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Trigger the command with rising edge. ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>PositionTolerance</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ 
			Position tolerance around the set position ([PosUnit], positive). The actual position must remain within this window for the command to succeed.
		 ]]></Comment><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>192</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>WaitDuration</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Duration (in seconds) that the actual position needs to consecutively stay inside the position window. Must have a value >= 0. ]]></Comment><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>256</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TimeoutDuration</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ 
			Duration (in seconds) after which an error is triggered if the actual position is not inside the position window.
			It can be left as 'Ignore' if no timeout is desired, otherwise must have a value > WaitDuration.
		 ]]></Comment><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>320</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>InPositionWindow</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Actual position is currently inside the position window. ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>384</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Done</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Actual position has been consecutively inside the position window for at least WaitDuration. ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>392</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Busy</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Function block is not finished and new output values are to be expected. ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>400</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Active</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Function block has active control on the axis.
